  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AUC 2022-2025 Support to the AU-MISAHEL Office - Support to African Union for Mali and the Sahel (Misahel)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AUC 2022-2025: St&#xF6;d till AUs MISAHEL-kontor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let f&#xF6;r Afrikanska unionens strategi f&#xF6;r h&#xE5;llbar fred och integrerad utveckling i Sahel &#xE4;r att uppn&#xE5; h&#xE5;llbar fred och integrerad utveckling genom:

- Fr&#xE4;mja r&#xE4;ttsstatsprincipen och st&#xE4;rka de demokratiska institutionerna.

- fr&#xE4;mja regionalt s&#xE4;kerhetssamarbete, och

- samordna initiativ f&#xF6;r integrerad utveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the African Union Strategy for Sustainable Peace and Integrated Development in the Sahel aims at achieving sustainable peace and integrated development through:

- Promoting the rule of law and strengthening democratic institutions

- Promoting regional security cooperation; and

- Coordinating integrated development initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The lack of development in the sub-region over the years has likely impaired the ability of existing governments to meet the needs of their citizens. This has been particularly noticeable through population growth, as well as environmental, economic, political, and security tensions, which have led to a decline in the quality of life of the population.

The overall objective of the African Union Strategy for Sustainable Peace and Integrated Development in the Sahel aims at achieving sustainable peace and integrated development through:

- Promoting the rule of law and strengthening democratic institutions

- Promoting regional security cooperation; and

- Coordinating integrated development initiatives.</narrative>
  </description>
